WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.620
Don't try it. You'll just get hurt.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:23.290
If you hand over your Artifact,
nice and easy, I'll at least spare your life.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.700
No way.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.790
I'm not sure what the situation is,

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.830
but I agree with you that
we can't trust what she says.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.250
Children should listen to
what adults tell them to do.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.000
Good adults, maybe.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.910
You really are annoying brats. In that case,

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.410
how about you trade it for this?

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.000
The Bow of the Earth God...!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.950
Wind?!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.370
Sassy little boys...

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:57.450
...need a good spanking.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.450
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:17.370
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:23.200
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.000
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.160
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:35.540
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:45.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:51.660
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.580
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:55.870
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:59.080
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.000
<i>so find me</i>

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.200
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:07.330
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:08.620
<i>Come after me</i>

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:13.790
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:16.660
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:21.370
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.750
Makoto!

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:36.580
Makoto!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:39.080
Dina, run away...!

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:44.790
If you value that girl's life,
tell me the true name of your wand.

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:48.200
Do not hurt Makoto any further!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.040
No, Dina...

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:56.790
Know-nothing little girl,
I may hate children who are sassy,

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:59.250
but children who are ignorant?

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.870
I hate them even more!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.620
Don't let go!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.790
Dina!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:19.250
You still have another Artifact?!
I'll take that one, too!

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:22.750
You can stand there and be plugged
full of holes, or hand that one over,

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:26.200
and tell me the true names of both of them.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:30.620
All right. I'll give you this one, too,
and tell you its true name.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.830
So let Dina go!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.540
Makoto!

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.910
You've finally come around, then?

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:46.750
I'll only have a second to act.
She thinks this is an Artifact.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:50.410
The moment I hand it over to her,
I'll take Smile Stick back,

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:53.330
and transport Dina away.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:57.370
I may not survive, but at least Dina will.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.450
Stop.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.540
Set it down right there.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.200
All right.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.750
Return to me, Smile Sti--!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.580
Makoto!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.410
Aw, what a shame.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:20.250
I don't know what you were scheming,

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:25.500
but right now, you're going to
tell me the true name of your wand.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.700
Well?!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:33.660
Its true name... is...

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.450
Hatena...?

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:02.250
Are you the one who did this?

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:06.290
Is that... the brilliance of her Artifact?

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:11.160
I asked you if you're the
one who did this to Makoto!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.410
So what if I did?!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.950
Fire!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.750
Hatena, be careful!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.790
Findabair, Draíocht!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:44.410
You'll pay for this--using Artifacts
like you are to hurt people...

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:49.410
You think I won't call
your bluff?! I'll blow you away!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:58.620
What is happening here? Is this Muff-<i>kun</i>'s--

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.040
Is this Hatena's power?

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.080
You did this...

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.120
...to Makoto!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.080
That's impossible...

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.290
Why, you...!

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.200
No, Hatena!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:34.450
The master thief Hatena may steal
things, but she does not hurt people.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.160
You can thank Mama's teachings for that.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:54.080
It's over now. Hand over the
Bow of the Earth God, nice and easy.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.200
It is fantastic, all right.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:12.080
I'd expect nothing less from
Hoshisato Maeve's Artifact.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.580
The tables have turned, haven't they?!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:29.830
I'll kill you right here.
I'll kill you, then take your Artifact.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.410
I can always dissect its true name later.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.910
That's not going to happen.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:36.830
Huh?!

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:42.160
My Smile Stick is still working
as usual inside this barrier.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:47.080
That's the kind of Artifact it is!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.250
Ha! What a bunch of hot air!

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.370
You'll see soon enough if it's just hot air.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:57.620
Hatena, sit tight. I'm going to
put an end to this right now.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.290
When we get home, I'll show you...

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:04.870
...the magic trick I've been
saving--the one Dina can't do.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.660
Makoto...

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:10.330
It's showtime!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.200
Matter transformation!
If you shoot, it'll explode!

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.870
Sorry we took so long.

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:34.790
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>!

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:38.620
Thank goodness you're alive...

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.910
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>...

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.000
Makoto!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:49.330
Mistresses, if you hug Makoto-<i>sama</i>
too hard, you might just finish him off.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:52.370
S-Sorry! You're hurt, aren't you?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.540
I-I'm fine...

00:08:54.540 --> 00:09:00.580
I have to admit, I didn't know
Smile Stick had that kind of power.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.330
Ha, ha, ha, it doesn't.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.160
Huh?

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:10.120
Honestly, "matter transformation" my foot.
If she had actually shot you...

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.290
...you would be dead.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.620
Huh?!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:21.580
But leave it to you, Dina.
You knew what I was getting at,

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.870
and diverted her attention just like <i>that</i>.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:29.290
You did pretty well, yourself,
in that split second.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.700
Is that right?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:38.040
H-Hold on a minute! Dina, your, um, chest...!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.250
I thought it might be the case,

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:43.290
but sure enough, you did not catch on, did you?

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:47.450
Mistress Kana, Dina-<i>sama </i>is a girl.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.000
Big sister, you're dense.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.660
I just found out a little earlier myself.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.500
Huh?!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.040
Michelle Li,

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.700
forgive me, but I'm taking back
the Bow of the Earth God

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.870
and Orb of Disillusionment.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:15.660
Kid, I'm grateful to you for keeping Dina safe.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:20.080
No, I'm the grateful one. I had a lot of help.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:25.160
Dina is a girl and spent
the whole night with Makoto...

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.700
Hatena!

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.500
It would appear that she has
had more than she can take.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:39.580
My Precious! Good grief, this is
what happens when you go overboard.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.450
Welcome home, everyone!

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.330
Hey, Kokomi!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.500
Whoa!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.950
Get this! You'll be so surprised!

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:52.330
It turns out that Dina is actually a girl!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:52.830
--Huh?

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.080
--I know, right?
--Huh?

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.450
Yeah, right. You're just now finding out?

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:57.700
--Huh?

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:58.660
--So, Dina, why do you dress like a boy?
--Huh?

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.040
--So, Dina, why do you dress like a boy?

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:05.160
It's because Uncle Gregory
only takes boys on as apprentices.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.950
I don't remember ever deciding that.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:12.790
Huh?! You said it yourself, Uncle!
That girls were no good!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.330
Oh, that doesn't sound like something I'd say...

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:18.040
Uncle...!

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:24.370
Now, now, we can discuss our
misunderstandings later, right?

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.450
Come on, Hatena, let's go.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.790
Dina, chin up.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:40.660
Okay, transport these items to Lároutir Village!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:47.330
Now big sister Maeve will be released.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.580
Yumemi!

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.790
Mother...

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:52.250
...is finally coming home!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:59.080
At least she was supposed to.
Everyone believed she would.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:01.830
Muff-<i>kun</i>, Solais!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:08.000
That was a pretty good attack.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.830
You're not going to use any Artifacts?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:16.790
Mm-mm, I don't want to use them in my magic.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:21.330
I want to be an accomplished
magician on my own, like Gregory-<i>sensei</i>.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:26.500
Hmm, you really are worthy to
be the junior apprentice under me.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.040
Before long, the season became summer.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.120
Big brother!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.330
Sei! Are you being a good girl?

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:44.910
I sure am! How are you, big brother?

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.370
I'm fine.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:50.410
Makoto, how's school?
Are you getting along all right?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:54.120
Mm-hmm, I'm enjoying it every day.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:57.790
There aren't many boys,
though, so it's a bit alienating.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:01.410
Which may be the reason
why we have such a kinship.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.250
Makoto, bring everyone
and come visit us sometime.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:10.500
Mm-hmm, once Maeve-<i>san</i>
gets back, I'll bring it up.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:17.830
When <i>is </i>Maeve-<i>san </i>getting back?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.450
Makoto!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.870
We got a letter from the village!

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:26.660
It is a message from Morrigan-<i>sama</i>.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:31.750
It says we have to obtain
another designated Artifact.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:36.660
Is Mother ever really coming home?

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:43.830
There's no other choice, is there, Makoto?

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:46.790
M-Mm-hmm.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:54.000
Security has been completely
shut down. Gaugau will lead the way.

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.750
Thank you, Yumemi. Always impressive.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.000
Let's go, Makoto.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.370
Mm-hmm.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.450
Is that it, Gaugau?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.870
Gaugau, disengage the alarm.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:19.160
It has Mother's crest.
This is it, all right. Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.870
There, let's get it.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.830
Wait!

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:30.290
It is my mission to steal sadness from others!

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:34.200
The master thief Hatena is on
the scene, just as she announced!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.580
You, too, Makoto.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.750
Huh? But there's no one here.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:41.790
We do it anyway! That's the
master thief Hatena's way!

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.410
Oh, all right.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:48.580
Also here, to turn sadness into smiles,
I-I am Makoto the Magician.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:53.040
Hmm... Well, I guess that will have to do.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.160
Okay, got it! That was easy!

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.200
Hatena!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.370
What's that?!

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.200
Huh?

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.830
Hatena!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.040
Hatena!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.200
C-Come on, you...!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.450
It can't be! It's strangling you?!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:43.080
You can stay there like that
and let your head be cut off.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:48.120
I can also crush you under pressure,
or blow you to smithereens.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:51.250
So this is <i>your </i>doing. Let Hatena out of there!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:56.250
"<i>Your </i>doing"? You should learn your place!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.370
Hatena!

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:06.160
What's wrong? Go ahead and call out
the power of Findabair, like you did before.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.500
Smile Stick!

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:14.660
Huh? What's wrong?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.000
Gaugau!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.910
So our Artifacts have been neutralized.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.750
You are about to find out the hard way...

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:27.040
...what happens when you mess with Artifacts!

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:35.000
A-Aah! Hatena!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.700
Stop! Please stop!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:42.790
I'll do anything! Just let Hatena go!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.410
I think that's enough.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:56.370
Maeve-<i>san</i>? Mariah-<i>san</i>, too?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:03.120
You're being much too stern, Mother.
She's your own granddaughter.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:15.790
You're...!

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.790
I still have not acknowledged you.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:29.790
Nonetheless, it does not change the fact
that she is your granddaughter, Mother.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.870
It has been some time, Morrigan-<i>sama</i>.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:42.540
Do you think that if you gang up,
you can stand up to me?

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.790
Now, that's a good question...

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:50.080
...since you are likely a duplicate
created by an Artifact.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.450
Care to try me and see?!

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:11.080
Hatena!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.580
Hatena! Hatena!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:24.080
Grandmother Morrigan,
you came here to show me...

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:28.950
...that I am still unseasoned, right?

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:34.000
It's true, just because I drew out
a little of Muff-<i>kun</i>'s power,

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.450
I may have gotten ahead of myself.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:43.040
When compared to Mama, and Mariah-<i>san</i>,

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:48.200
and Papa, Ema-<i>san</i>, and Jeeves-<i>san</i>,

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.910
I'm still lagging far behind...

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.370
But...

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:57.330
I will get much, much,
much stronger, you'll see!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:03.500
Strong enough that
someday, I'll catch up to you!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.790
Ho...

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.700
After all, I am the daughter
of the master thief Maeve,

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.000
the master thief Hatena!

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.700
Kana...

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:17.830
But it's more than just that.

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:20.750
I have my sister, Yumemi, whom I can depend on,

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:24.450
and the best partner in the world.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:27.500
Isn't that right, Makoto?

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.200
Mm-hmm.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:35.410
You're going to get stronger because
you have others to support you?

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:43.830
That's something a child would say!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.290
Is it, though?

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:59.700
I don't think she's entirely
wrong about that, Mother.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:03.200
Though coming from me, that
probably doesn't sound too convincing.

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:19.250
Hmph, this is some real insignificant
family drama I'm witnessing.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:23.500
Mariah, what are you going to do?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:26.540
You're siding with them, too, huh?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:34.500
May the Star's guidance be upon you.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:48.370
In the end, love always does prevail.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.870
Is that a line from somewhere?

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:54.950
It is a universal principle.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:21:00.040
Kana, well said. Don't forget how you feel now.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.790
Mama... Mama!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.200
Mother!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.580
Yumemi, I'm home.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:13.080
I'm sorry I was away for so long,
and for how much you missed me.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:17.000
Mm-mm, it wasn't your fault.

